{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:01 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:01 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:01 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"一樓一劏房單位女子遇襲受傷，事件涉及「業務糾紛」。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/e229b15e307a3f94dac21d1f4aa0a43d/2026-10/page1_14.jpg\"/><p>今日（21 日）早上10時50分，警方接獲深水埗福榮街120號一名女子報案，指她被一名男子用凳襲擊，並搶去500元。人員到場後在一劏房單位尋獲報案的女事主，她手腳受傷，單位的木門亦損毀。</p><p>現場所見，涉事劏房是一樓一單位。警方經調查後相信事件涉及「業務糾紛」，並以涉嫌刑事毀壞，拘捕涉案男子。女事主其後由救護車送往明愛醫院治理。</p><img alt=\"警員在涉事的一樓一劏房單位調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5ff271924491dfc3bb946b73a913657b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_36_06_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8a7fd89df819d0c5a05e455244f44461/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_36_06.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1c2768a484f28c415f67e7d10b2427a9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_37_05_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dc794a199b0f4ce1db3afbe482a7745e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_37_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是深水埗福榮街120號。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bce108b527580018b57d9535cda76552/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_37_05.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/741dd74f9df8e0b3450a8a4cb211d587/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_37_04_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/26aebb09a85a11bc5fc85ba32be39a32/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_37_04.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/07cbc5983c70bd3aeb5665c5f721d5f1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_37_03_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女傷者由救護車送往明愛醫院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ed563240565f42412ce0419b8082f3f0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_37_03_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/245994fb1d2bc3545b1aebcccd426352/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_37_03.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/09c1840cad14972c5d7264f7f95b3b69/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_37_02.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8ad15827c34992a5092990d5390a5f6c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_12_36_07.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:41:13.923886+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":13,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:01:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T09:58:30.036958+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:37:40.671445+00:00","content_hash":"2f723a42bd5ccbf16288c63b8aea8f433e77b8f090745540df6f6ab3479e544c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}